{"id":762,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><div><p>2025年2月21日下午，体育学院本科生党支部在院楼二层会议室开展了关于中共中央国务院印发《教育强国建设规划纲要（2024—2035年）》（以下简称《纲要》）的学习会议。李士荣老师及李佳怿老师出席会议并讲话，由学生党员孙董悦领学。</p><p>会议上，李士荣老师首先针对《纲要》里的总体要求作出总结并分别从工作要求和主要目标发表讲话。随后，李佳怿老师就《纲要》的后续重点内容进行概括解读。最后由孙董悦同学介绍《纲要》细则并领学。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NUNCT8UNLZMRUPMt8CYLlV7L4LPMNMj7oR-Dnz9PM7r2M8-0gihFp2hmCIa0MShRU1yPL1ybM4fVMRAknz9ZLmGbnzCbn7UbU8l8UzLbnNWFnRUbU4LPLRQFoRMRM8-Jv2bjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg474L4UagtA8pUwcc&oid=1054562613&tid=1046&nid=13340&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/5CB12970E48BE88209E69DD9CE4A39FB/D49C3106/83C7B\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NUNCT8UNLZMRUPMt8CYLlV7L4LPMNMj7oR-Dnz9PM7r2M8-0gihFp2hmCIa0MShRU1yPL1ybM4fVMRAknz9ZLmGbnzCbn7UbU8l8UzLbnNWFnRUbU4LPLRQFoRMRM8-Jv2bjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg474L4UagtA8pUwcc&oid=1054562613&tid=1046&nid=13340&e=.png\"></p><p><br /></p></div></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://tyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NUNCT8UNLZMRUPMt8CYLlV7L4LPMNMj7oR-Dnz9PM7r2M8-0gihFp2hmCIa0MShRU1yPL1ybM4fVMRAknz9ZLmGbnzCbn7UbU8l8UzLbnNWFnRUbU4LPLRQFoRMRM8-Jv2bjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg474L4UagtA8pUwcc&oid=1054562613&tid=1046&nid=13340&e=.png"}